{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Disastory is a choice-driven roleplaying adventure filled with bad dad jokes and one dimensional characters that just wont shut up! </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Explore a fantastic industrial city and its surroundings full of wacky characters and ridiculous adventures.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395240/extras/WeShouldKillHimOptimized.gif?t=1737561477\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What's in this demo?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 unique playable characters each with 2-3 default traits and 2 optional traits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">39 in-game achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">80.000 words worth of narrative content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">13 unique locations\u00a0 + several sub-locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">53 unique items each with their own use</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">100+ Unique scenarios</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Make dumb choices!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make thousands of unique (terrible) choices!  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Experience real consequences for your (dumb-ass) actions! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Decorate your home! (dead bodies included) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Go to jail! (we're not saying you'll end up there, but you know how things go...)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395240/extras/Make_Dumb_Choices.png?t=1737561477\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3395240?t=1737561477","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/